@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed — Alternate paths, duplicate commands and uncertain effects
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Caller
participant "Resource owner" as O
participant "Current policy / version / identity guard" as G
participant "Actual external adapter, only if operation requires it" as A
Caller -> O : exact intent + expected context + command identity
O -> G : current admission and same-intent outcome lookup
alt denied / stale / changed intent under same identity
 G --> O : safe denial / conflict
 O --> Caller : no new admitted mutation; protected frame preserved
else prior same-intent result
 G --> O : recorded outcome
 O --> Caller : currently permitted projection
else eligible new intent
 O -> G : coherent local state/result or durable external intent
 opt explicitly required consequential external operation
  O -> A : same attributable attempt after current eligibility
  alt actual effect established
   A --> O : evidence-supported actual result
  else partial / unknown observation
   A --> O : retain known effects and same-attempt uncertainty
   loop bounded observation only if actually supported and authorized
    O -> A : reconcile existing attempt, not new dispatch
    A --> O : evidence or unavailable
   end
  end
 end
 O --> Caller : truthful permitted committed / pending / partial / unknown result
end

@enduml
